# interpolation_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- intro

~ var $town := "Saltmere"
~ var $trust := 30
~ var $bells_struck := 2

WREN
  Welcome to $town.
  Trust meter: $trust.

-- composite

WREN
  The bell has struck $bells_struck times today.

WREN { soft }
  That's ${$trust + 5} on the trust scale, give or take.

-- gone

WREN
  And the keeper? $ghost.
